{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/separate-turn-into-text",
  "seed": "Turn into Text: a separated run of text becomes words you can retype. The walk opens a settings pane capture, asks for the words on the WHOLE picture first to prove it says to separate it first, separates it, turns the white label on the blue button into real text, turns the heading into real text, retypes the button's label, and takes both back with undo.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "do": "open",
      "file": "../../Tests/PhotonzRenderTests/Fixtures/settings-pane-2x.png",
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 900
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "zoomToFit"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "showInspector"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "0-before",
      "note": "the capture as it opens: one locked Background picture and nothing else"
    },
    {
      "do": "rightClick",
      "on": "Background",
      "shot": "text-1-row-menu",
      "choose": "Turn into Text"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 2
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "1-a-whole-page-is-not-one-run",
      "note": "THE FIRST TEST: asking for the words on a whole screenshot is a signpost rather than a dead end. The pill says there is more than one run of text here and to separate it first, and the picture is untouched"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "row": "Background",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "text-1-separate-first"
    },
    {
      "do": "rightClick",
      "on": "Background",
      "choose": "Separate into Layers"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 3
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "row": "Save Changes",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "2-separated",
      "note": "the nine runs are their own layers, and each row already says the words in it, read off the pixels for its NAME (SeparatedBoxNames). A name is all that was read: every one of them is still a PICTURE of a label until Turn into Text, and the dock proves it by offering no Text section on any of them."
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "text-2-separated"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "do": "selectRow",
      "row": "Save Changes"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Text section",
      "present": false
    },
    {
      "do": "menus",
      "stage": "layer-menu",
      "menu": "Layer"
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "turnIntoText"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 2.5
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "3-white-on-blue-becomes-words",
      "note": "THE SECOND TEST: this run is WHITE words on a solid blue button, the hardest reading on the page. It is real text now, and the dock says so: the Text section with its face, its size and its alignment buttons is there, where a moment ago there was none. The pill names the face the words were set in, and the canvas is identical because the words went back exactly where they were"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "row": "Save Changes",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "control": "Text section",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "text-3-save-changes"
    },
    {
      "do": "render",
      "name": "text-3-save-changes-doc"
    },
    {
      "do": "selectRow",
      "row": "General"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "do": "action",
      "action": "turnIntoText"
    },
    {
      "do": "wait",
      "seconds": 2.5
    },
    {
      "do": "describe",
      "stage": "4-the-heading-too",
      "note": "THE THIRD TEST: the heading is the other end of the range, bold and large. It comes back as the word General at its own weight, not at the row labels'"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "row": "General",
      "present": true
    },
    {
      "do": "snapshot",
      "name": "text-4-heading"
    },
    {
      "do": "render",
      "name": "text-4-heading-doc"
    },
    {
      "do": "tool",
      "tool": "select"
    },
    {
      "do": "click",
      "at": [
        146,
        85
